WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
Think about the two people you can imagine

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.850
who'd be least likely to be baking cookies together.

3
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.450
It's John Travolta and Tommy Lee.

4
00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.860
Yeah, huh.

5
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.560
The New York Post Reports,

6
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.910
apparently they love trading baking recipe.

7
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.310
Tommy Lee posted a video on TikTok

8
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.120
showing his pal, John, texting him one Wednesday night,

9
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.470
asking for his killer peanut butter chocolate chip recipe.

10
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.400
And later John shared a pic of his cookies in the oven,

11
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.110
calling himself a regular Johnny Crocker.

12
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.660
And we're in luck because guess what?

13
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.320 line:15%
We've got some of Tommy Lee's special recipes right here.

14
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.860 line:15%
Oh my gosh.

15
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.920 line:15%
This is the actual peanut butter cookie recipe

16
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.850 line:15%
and he does it with chocolate chips in it.

17
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.763 line:15%
I heard John Travolta also drinks it with lemonade.

18
00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.080
I feel like this is wrong on many levels,

19
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.483
but I'm gonna try it.

20
00:00:53.483 --> 00:00:55.270
(audience laughs)

21
00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.103
Boy, there's a little salt.

22
00:00:56.103 --> 00:00:58.883
Okay, yeah, ooh, Tommy Lee.

23
00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:02.594
(audience laughs)

24
00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:05.870
Drew, you cannot tell me

25
00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.590
that's not a great peanut butter cookie.

26
00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.588
No, it is.

27
